{"contract_version": "1.2.0", "query_id": "wp2_0000", "query": "[to be written by the annotator]", "domain": "immigration_eligibility", "construction": "split", "separation": "same_guide", "passages": [{"id": "p0", "text": "You must pay the healthcare surcharge for each year of your stay", "source_type": "government_guidance", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/skilled-worker-visa", "document_id": "skilled-worker-visa#overview"}, {"id": "p1", "text": "If you’re a doctor or nurse, or you work in health or adult social care, check if you’re eligible to apply for the Health and Care Worker visa instead. It’s cheaper to apply for and you do not need to pay the annual immigration health surcharge.", "source_type": "government_guidance", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/skilled-worker-visa/how-much-it-costs", "document_id": "skilled-worker-visa#how-much-it-costs"}], "conflict_pairs": [], "multi_exception_flags": {"nested": false, "crossed": false}}
{"contract_version": "1.2.0", "query_id": "wp2_0001", "query": "[to be written by the annotator]", "domain": "immigration_eligibility", "construction": "natural", "separation": "cross_document", "passages": [{"id": "p0", "text": "You cannot extend your Graduate visa.", "source_type": "government_guidance", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/graduate-visa", "document_id": "graduate-visa#overview"}, {"id": "p1", "text": "You may be able to extend your visa if you’re eligible, for example to continue your studies in the UK.", "source_type": "government_guidance", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/student-visa", "document_id": "student-visa#overview"}], "conflict_pairs": [], "multi_exception_flags": {"nested": false, "crossed": false}}
{"contract_version": "1.2.0", "query_id": "wp2_0002", "query": "[to be written by the annotator]", "domain": "immigration_eligibility", "construction": "split", "separation": "same_guide", "passages": [{"id": "p0", "text": "You can apply for a Youth Mobility Scheme visa if you: have £2,530 in savings", "source_type": "government_guidance", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/youth-mobility", "document_id": "youth-mobility#overview"}, {"id": "p1", "text": "You must have at least £2,530 in your bank account to show you can support yourself in the UK. You will need to have had the money available for at least 28 days in a row.", "source_type": "government_guidance", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/youth-mobility/eligibility", "document_id": "youth-mobility#eligibility"}], "conflict_pairs": [], "multi_exception_flags": {"nested": false, "crossed": false}}
{"contract_version": "1.2.0", "query_id": "wp2_0003", "query": "[to be written by the annotator]", "domain": "immigration_eligibility", "construction": "split", "separation": "same_guide", "passages": [{"id": "p0", "text": "You’ll need to provide proof of your finances, if you’re not applying on the basis of your private life", "source_type": "government_guidance", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/uk-family-visa/provide-information", "document_id": "uk-family-visa#provide-information"}, {"id": "p1", "text": "You do not need to meet a minimum income requirement if your partner gets one of the following benefits: Disability Living Allowance, Scottish Adult Disability Living Allowance, Severe Disablement Allowance, Industrial Injuries Disablement Benefit, Attendance Allowance, Pension Age Disability Payment, Carer’s Allowance, Carer Support Payment, Personal Independence Payment, Armed Forces Independence Payment or Guaranteed Income Payment under the Armed Forces Compensation Scheme, Constant Attendance Allowance, Mobility Supplement or War Disablement Pension under the War Pensions Scheme, Police Injury Pension, Child Disability Payment, Adult Disability Payment", "source_type": "government_guidance", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/uk-family-visa/proof-income-partner", "document_id": "uk-family-visa#proof-income-partner"}], "conflict_pairs": [], "multi_exception_flags": {"nested": false, "crossed": false}}
{"contract_version": "1.2.0", "query_id": "wp2_0004", "query": "[to be written by the annotator]", "domain": "immigration_eligibility", "construction": "natural", "separation": "cross_document", "passages": [{"id": "p0", "text": "You may be able to apply for settlement once you’ve been in the UK for 3 years.", "source_type": "government_guidance", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/innovator-founder-visa", "document_id": "innovator-founder-visa#overview"}, {"id": "p1", "text": "You must have a new endorsement that shows you’ve met the requirements for growing your business", "source_type": "government_guidance", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/indefinite-leave-to-remain-innovator-founder-visa", "document_id": "indefinite-leave-to-remain-innovator-founder-visa#overview"}], "conflict_pairs": [], "multi_exception_flags": {"nested": false, "crossed": false}}
{"contract_version": "1.2.0", "query_id": "wp2_0005", "query": "[to be written by the annotator]", "domain": "financial_terms", "construction": "natural", "separation": "cross_document", "passages": [{"id": "p0", "text": "A dependent partner and dependent children can apply on this route.", "source_type": "unknown", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/guidance/immigration-rules/immigration-rules-appendix-skilled-worker", "document_id": "guidance/immigration-rules/immigration-rules-appendix-skilled-worker"}, {"id": "p1", "text": "Dependent partners and children can apply on this route (with some exceptions for dependants of care workers, senior care workers and medium skilled roles) as set out in the: Dependants guidance", "source_type": "unknown", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/skilled-worker-visa-caseworker-guidance/skilled-worker-caseworker-guidance-accessible", "document_id": "government/publications/skilled-worker-visa-caseworker-guidance/skilled-worker-caseworker-guidance-accessible"}], "conflict_pairs": [], "multi_exception_flags": {"nested": false, "crossed": false}}
{"contract_version": "1.2.0", "query_id": "wp2_0006", "query": "[to be written by the annotator]", "domain": "financial_terms", "construction": "natural", "separation": "cross_document", "passages": [{"id": "p0", "text": "You can stay for 3 years if you either: come to the UK on an Innovator Founder visa or switch to this visa from another visa while in the UK", "source_type": "government_guidance", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/innovator-founder-visa", "document_id": "innovator-founder-visa#overview"}, {"id": "p1", "text": "An applicant who is in the UK cannot apply to switch into the Innovator Founder route if they have, or were last granted, permission as any of the following: as a Visitor, as a Short-term Student, as a Parent of a Child Student, as a Seasonal Worker, as a domestic worker in a private household", "source_type": "unknown", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/innovator-appendix-w-workers/innovator-founder-caseworker-guidance-accessible", "document_id": "government/publications/innovator-appendix-w-workers/innovator-founder-caseworker-guidance-accessible"}], "conflict_pairs": [], "multi_exception_flags": {"nested": false, "crossed": false}}
{"contract_version": "1.2.0", "query_id": "wp2_0007", "query": "[to be written by the annotator]", "domain": "financial_terms", "construction": "natural", "separation": "cross_document", "passages": [{"id": "p0", "text": "(a) be studying a full-time course of study leading to the award of a PhD with a higher education provider which has a track record of compliance; and (ii) have completed at least 24 months of study on that course.", "source_type": "unknown", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/guidance/immigration-rules/immigration-rules-appendix-innovator-founder", "document_id": "guidance/immigration-rules/immigration-rules-appendix-innovator-founder"}, {"id": "p1", "text": "If the course was leading to a PhD award they must have completed at least 12 months of that course.", "source_type": "unknown", "date": null, "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/innovator-appendix-w-workers/innovator-founder-caseworker-guidance-accessible", "document_id": "government/publications/innovator-appendix-w-workers/innovator-founder-caseworker-guidance-accessible"}], "conflict_pairs": [], "multi_exception_flags": {"nested": false, "crossed": false}}
